      <title>Ep. 251: Takeaways from the Rams-Bills battle on MNF, Matthew Stafford's performance, previewing Week 6 vs. the Cardinals &amp; more</title>
      <itunes:title>Ep. 251: Takeaways from the Rams-Bills battle on MNF, Matthew Stafford's performance, previewing Week 6 vs. the Cardinals &amp; more</itunes:title>
      <description><![CDATA[On this episode of Between the Horns, J.B. Long, D’Marco Farr, and Maurice Jones-Drew reflect on the Los Angeles Rams' Week 5 matchup against the Buffalo Bills. Watch them discuss key lessons from the loss, break down pivotal plays, scout the Arizona Cardinals ahead of Week 6 matchup, and more.<p>See <a href="https://omnystudio.com/listener">omnystudio.com/listener</a> for privacy information.</p>]]></description>
